											class Value
											{
												class data
												{
													singleType="STRING";
													value="<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== SITUATION ===</font>         " \n "<br/><br/>       " \n "The drug lord is pushing out shipments since the last raid. The intel found from the previous raid has given us sufficient intel on another logistics hub deep within the jungle.  " \n "<br/><br/>     " \n "due to the success in the previous raid Task Force NAGA is still taking point for this operation. Unfortunately Air force will be down due to engine failure.  " \n "<br/><br/>  " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== Mission ===</font>   " \n "<br/><br/>   " \n "Raid the village, Find and secure intel on site and any caches. Further objectives will be provided if the mission changes. " \n "<br/><br/> " \n "<font face='PuristaBold' color='#fce300' size='15'>=== Extra notes/Optional ===</font>   " \n "<br/><br/> " \n "Follow the basic ROE, Bring those who are willing to comply into custody.";
												};
											};
